{"id":"n23510-2-9","stage":5,"title":"개봉 · 首映","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23510-2-9-1","ko":"이 영화 언제부터 상영하는지 알아?","zh":"你知道这部电影什么时候开始上映吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제부터","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상영하는지","meaning":"上映","explanation":"상영하다：上映；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"상영하다","audio":"/audio/7649b3acf84be7af8e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62774","senseId":"1","lemma":"상영하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알아?","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"7649b3acf84be7af","term":"상영하다","zh":"上映","au